          "margin_tag": "፲፰",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪፲፰ ፤ እስመ ፡ ዐበይተ ፡ ጌጋይ ፡ ነበቡ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 30,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "የኃጣውኡ ፡ ደጋጉን ። አንድም፡ ዓበይተ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 31,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ጌጋየ ፡ ደጋጉን ፡ ኃጣውእ ፡ ተናግረዋ",
