          "text": "ኦሪት ፡ የተመለሱ ። ሐተታ ፡ ጌጋይ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 9,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "አላት ፡ ትለፍ ፡ ካለ ፡ በኋላ ፡ ቢይዝዋት ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 10,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ፍዳን ፡ የምታመጣ ፡ ስለ ፡ ሆነ ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 11,
          "margin_tag": "፲፱",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪፲፱ ፤ እለ ፡ ሕገ ፡ ግዕዛን ፡ ተምህሩ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 12,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሕገ ፡ ግዕዛን ፡ ወንጌልን ፡ ተምረው ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 13,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወለሊሆሙኒ ፡ ቅኑያን ፡ ለሕርትምና ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 14,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ጥፋት ፡ ሊሆንባቸው ፡ ጥፋት ፡ ሊመጣባ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 15,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ቸው ፡ ለኦሪት ፡ የተገዙ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 16,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪እስመ ፡ ኵሉ ፡ ለዘተአዘዘ ፡ ውእቱ ፡ ይትቀነይ ።⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 17,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሰው ፡ ሁሉ ፡ ለታዘዘለት ፡ ይገዛልና ፤ ቅኑ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 18,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ያን ፡ ላለው ፡ ዮሐ ፡ ፰ ፥ ፴፬ ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 19,
          "margin_tag": "፳",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪፳ ፤ እስመ ፡ ለእመ ፡ ጐዩ ፡ እምኃጢአቱ ፡ ለዝንቱ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 20,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ዓለም ፡ በአእምሮቱ ፡ ለእግዚእነ ፡ ወመድኃኒነ ፡ ኢየ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 21,
